{"4895690": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "The Last Stand", "steam_appid": 4895690, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4895690/extras/877809349c9fc2ff48c125033aff4318.avif?t=1783437125\" width=780 height=250 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Last Stand is a medieval wave-based survival game where you take your last stand defending the people you care about as they make a hasty escape.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4895690/extras/d46d6d1cb72d93c39bc906ef082979fa.avif?t=1783437125\" width=780 height=68 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Face hordes of enemies</strong> with a wide variety of weapons and upgrade your arsenal as you progress.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4895690/extras/f85929e1a8fb196897f6a38fe47e0a9c.avif?t=1783437125\" width=780 height=250 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4895690/extras/613a1080ad37149b29ae2f2dadc079c9.avif?t=1783437125\" width=780 height=68 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore the castle</strong> to uncover hidden paths and the stories of those who came before you.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4895690/extras/2e9b1575bdb78a09ae7a4db2a61ff7cc.avif?t=1783437125\" width=780 height=250 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph